direction: down
spec: TASK.md
agent: coding agent
sandbox: worktree sandbox
tests: npm test
diffgate: diff under 400 lines
review: human review
main: main
spec -> agent: read task
agent -> sandbox: edit and run
sandbox -> tests: run suite
tests -> agent: red
tests -> diffgate: green
diffgate -> agent: too big, split
diffgate -> review: small diff
review -> agent: changes requested
review -> main: approve
